1
00:00:00,541 --> 00:00:02,251
(Penny:)Spider-Man. Get him Spider-Man.

2
00:00:02,418 --> 00:00:05,378
(Sheldon:)Amazing Spider-Man, Ultimate Spider-Man,
Spectacular Spider-Man...

3
00:00:05,546 --> 00:00:09,086
(Sheldon:)...The Marvelous Adventures of Spider-Man,
Spider-Man 2099?

4
00:00:09,758 --> 00:00:11,888
- Leonard?
LEONARD: This can go on all night.

5
00:00:12,052 --> 00:00:14,222
(Leonard:)Why don't you just come with us?

6
00:00:14,471 --> 00:00:17,391
(Penny:)Ugh. That's what I was trying to avoid.

7
00:00:18,225 --> 00:00:21,185
(Sheldon:)Oh, I forgot Sensational Spider-Man.

8
00:00:24,523 --> 00:00:27,233
(Penny:)Oh, what a cute little store.

9
00:00:30,821 --> 00:00:33,241
(Penny:)Everybody's staring at me.

10
00:00:34,491 --> 00:00:37,781
LEONARD: Don't worry. They're more
scared of you than you are of them.

11
00:00:38,912 --> 00:00:40,082
(Penny:)Unlikely.

12
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:45,040
(Penny:)Here. What about this one
for my nephew?

13
00:00:45,210 --> 00:00:47,460
- A superb choice.
- Oh, great.

14
00:00:47,629 --> 00:00:50,759
(Sheldon:)Yeah, provided he has already read
Infinite Crisis and 52...

15
00:00:50,924 --> 00:00:54,384
(Sheldon:)...and is familiar with the reestablishment
of the DC Multiverse.

16
00:00:55,888 --> 00:00:57,428
Uh, what's a Multiverse?

17
00:00:57,931 --> 00:01:00,021
(Sheldon:)Get her out of here.

